    "statement_text": "Conjecture Suppose that for all edges $ e\\in E(G) $ we have $ imb(e)>0 $ . Then $ M_{G} $ is graphic.",
    "context_text": "Consider simple undirected graph $ G $ and let $ e=uv\\in E(G) $ . The imbalance of the edge $ e $ defined as $ imb(e)=|deg(u)-deg(v)| $ . The multiset of all edge imbalances of $ G $ is denoted by $ M_{G} $ . Note, that conjecture is verified for all such graphs with $ \\leq 9 $ vertices.",
